cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use iLOX, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "iLOX: InterLocking Orthogonal eXtrusions"
abstract: >-
  An OpenSCAD library for joints that print as two separate parts and
  interlock. A 2D unit cell is split along a division line into two halves, a
  clearance apart, which are extruded and repeated across two substrates as
  linear rails or radial pins.
authors:
